# Design system

- Reuse existing primitives and semantic tokens before adding a new abstraction. Inspect current component props instead of copying a catalog signature.
- Tokens live in `packages/web/src/shared/lib/themes/`; Tailwind mapping lives in `packages/web/tailwind.config.ts`.
- When a new token is necessary, update its type, palettes, CSS initialization, and Tailwind mapping together as applicable.
- Preserve accessible names, focus behavior, and interaction states. Product-specific data loading belongs in an owning feature/entity, not a shared visual primitive.
- Explicit user design requirements take precedence over generic grid or token preferences; see `design-reference.mdc`.
